		(uuid "b935e45a-746b-4f2c-91a6-c506c292774a")
	)
	(text "U3 is MCP73832 (open-drain STAT), not MCP73831.\nR3 = 2k: nominal 500mA charge. Q6 opens PROG return during actuation.\nBAT_PROT comes from full-input U13 on the Actuators sheet.\nMatch cell/USB budget; bench-check Q6 charge current and off leakage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.40 226.06 0)
		(effects (font (face "Courier New") (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "b4c5475a-d23d-407b-8fdc-6a1a786e8e3e")
	)
	(text "MAX17048: I2C1 / address 0x36.\nCELL + VDD -> BAT_PROT; CTG/QSTRT/EP -> GND.\nAS5600 has its own bus to avoid address collision."
